  "pay.3ds.h": ["3D Secure SMS Doğrulama Kodu", "3D Secure SMS verification code", "3D-Secure-SMS-Code", "رمز تحقق 3D Secure عبر SMS", "Код 3D Secure из SMS"],
  "pay.3ds.p": ["Kayıtlı cep telefonunuza ({phone}) 6 haneli kod gönderildi. Kodu girmeden ödeme onaylanmaz ve paket tanımlanmaz.", "A 6-digit code was sent to your registered mobile ({phone}). Payment is not approved and the plan is not activated until you verify it.", "Ein 6-stelliger Code wurde an Ihr Mobiltelefon ({phone}) gesendet. Ohne Prüfung keine Zahlung und kein Tarif.", "أُرسل رمز من 6 أرقام إلى جوالك المسجّل ({phone}). لن تُعتمد الدفعة ولن تُفعّل الباقة قبل التحقق.", "На зарегистрированный телефон ({phone}) отправлен 6-значный код. Без проверки оплата и тариф не активируются."],
  "pay.3ds.code": ["SMS doğrulama kodu", "SMS verification code", "SMS-Code", "رمز SMS", "Код из SMS"],
